Design payment gateway
An online platform that securely captures user payment details and orchestrates transactions between
merchants and financial processors.

merchant -> amazon , flipkart , any shop 
payment gateway , payment processor -> stripe

stripe as payment gateway : securely collects payment details and routes payment requests.
stripe as a payment processor : facilitates transactions between merchants and the relevant banking
                                and payment networks.

payment gateway :-
a payment gateway is the platform that collects payment details from users , secures and
tokenizes them , orchestrates the transaction flow , and communiates with the payment
processor.
gateway = "traffic controller of payments"

orchestration -> coordinating all the components involved in completing a payment.

payment processor :-
a payment processor is the financial network entity that actually talks to banks and 
card networks to authorize , capture , and settle the money.
processor = "the system that actually moves the money"


